#. ja: リプレイレディチェックを開始します。<br>全員が「はい」を押した時点から記録を開始し、設定された時間で戦闘開始カウントが実行されます。<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※2回目以降は記録に対する確認は含まれず、レディチェックと戦闘開始カウントが実行されます。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Es wird eine Bereitschaftsanfrage für die Aufzeichnung einer Rückblende gestartet.<br>Sobald alle Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glieder bereit sind, starten der Inhalts-Timer und die Aufzeichnung.<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※ Beim nächsten Mal kann die normale Bereitschaftsanfrage gestellt werden.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Appel d'enregistrement</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Dès que tous les équipiers auront répondu “Oui”, l'enregistrement commencera et le compte à rebours du combat sera lancé.<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>* À partir de la seconde tentative, il n'y aura aucune confirmation pour l'enregistrement, mais un appel de préparation et un compte à rebours seront effectués.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:3104:0:0"
msgid "Initiating <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>record ready check</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Countdown will start and duty will begin recording once all duty members have selected “Yes.”<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※A confirmation prompt will not appear for future recordings.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Начинается <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>проверка готовности для записи</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Когда все участники нажмут «Да», начнётся запись прохождения и обратный отсчёт до начала боя.<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※ При следующих записях подтверждение не потребуется.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: リプレイレディチェックを開始します。<br>メンバー全員が「はい」を押した時点から記録を開始し、<br>設定された時間で戦闘開始カウントが実行されます。<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※2回目以降は記録に対する確認は含まれず、<br>　レディチェックと戦闘開始カウントが実行されます。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Es wird eine Bereitschaftsanfrage für die Aufzeichnung einer Rückblende gestartet.<br>Sobald alle Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glieder bereit sind, starten der Inhalts-Timer und die Aufzeichnung.<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※ Beim nächsten Mal kann die normale Bereitschaftsanfrage gestellt werden.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Appel d'enregistrement</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Dès que tous les équipiers auront répondu “Oui”, l'enregistrement commencera et le compte à rebours du combat sera lancé.<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>* À partir de la seconde tentative, il n'y aura aucune confirmation pour l'enregistrement, mais un appel de préparation et un compte à rebours seront effectués.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:3105:0:0"
msgid "Initiating <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>record ready check</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Countdown will start and duty will begin recording<br>once all duty members have selected “Yes.”<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※A confirmation prompt will not appear<br>　for future recordings.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Начинается <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>проверка готовности для записи</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Когда все участники нажмут «Да», начнётся запись прохождения,<br>а затем — обратный отсчёт до начала боя.<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>※ При следующих записях подтверждение не потребуется.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

