msgstr "Назад"

#. ja: ここではグランドカンパニー<sheet GrandCompany $n1 0>所属者に対し、<br>「軍票」と引き替えに、役立つ品々を支給しています。
#. de: Nur Mitglieder <noun-de GrandCompany 2 $n1 1 2 1> können hier Waren und Dienste erhalten.
#. fr: Seuls les membres <if ($n1 == 1)>du Maelstrom<else><if ($n1 == 2)>de l'ordre des Deux Vipères<else>des Immortels</if></if> peuvent utiliser des sceaux pour acheter des produits.
#. macro: <sheet GrandCompany $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GrandCompany, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>storm<else><if ($n1 == 2)>serpent<else>flame</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 2)>serpent<else>flame</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:3292:0:0"
msgid "Only members of the <sheet GrandCompany $n1 0> are allowed to exchange <if ($n1 == 1)>storm<else><if ($n1 == 2)>serpent<else>flame</if></if> seals for goods and services."
msgstr "Только члены великой компании <sheet GrandCompany $n1 0> могут обменивать <if ($n1 == 1)>печати Бури<else><if ($n1 == 2)>печати Змей<else>печати Пламени</if></if> на товары и услуги."

